# MVP

Multi-tenant school SaaS. Org data isolated. Super Admin = orgs/plans/global bank/taxonomy/settings + approve suggestions. Org Admin = teachers/schedules/org tests/branding. Teacher = assigned schedules, auto/manual papers, suggest questions, edit/export own tests.

Hierarchy: Board → Class → Subject → Chapter → Topic → Question (one topic). Global bank; teachers suggest only. Types: MCQ (4 opts), Short, Long.

Generate: chapters → topics (editable). Auto balanced (default, 1/topic/round) or random, or manual. Post-edit: replace/remove/add/reorder. Schedule locks subject + exam date; schedule name = test type. Delete teacher/schedule keeps papers. Visibility: teacher own, org admin org, super admin all. Export: print/PDF with org logo/header/marks/time/instructions. SMTP: day-before reminders.

V2+: student portal, online exams, billing, analytics, audit, Excel, AI questions, Word polish.
